WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.815
Module 1.

00:00:01.815 --> 00:00:03.590
Foundations & Safety.

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.550
Part of Stage 1, Foundations.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.983
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:08.983 --> 00:00:10.828
able to set up and use a wallet

00:00:10.828 --> 00:00:13.665
safely; know what can go irreversibly wrong.

00:00:13.665 --> 00:00:15.020
That's the standard.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.990
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.625
There are 9 lessons, starting with What

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:23.085
DeFi is — and the risk-first mindset.

00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:25.064
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:27.335
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:28.635 --> 00:00:30.202
If the topic is new to

00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:32.955
you, start with Mastery Starter 1.0.

00:00:32.955 --> 00:00:34.850
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.004
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:39.135
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:40.942
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:40.942 --> 00:00:42.975
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:44.275 --> 00:00:46.760
Let's begin, with lesson 1.0.
